    "steam_appid": 2420890,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420890/extras/3c6dd9a7b03e4a02f2825304f70b6af1.avif?t=1723461498\" /></span><br><br>By the will of fate, Jake finds himself in an abandoned building, from which there is no way out, and becomes a participant in a deadly game. But he's not alone here. Teaming up with another player, he will have to complete tasks and move forward.<br><br><i>Why are they here? Who is behind all this? And will they be able to get out of here alive?</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420890/extras/ab409186de744e0432c2044c4339b0cc.webp?t=1723461498\" /></span><br><br>Devil Apartment is a mystery visual novel with a dark atmosphere. An emotional story about cruelty, hatred and remorse, showing what people are capable of under the pressure of circumstances. Read and make choices that affect the fate of the characters. See the world through their eyes. And remember: there are few choices, but each of them matters.<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A tragic story with multiple endings<br></li><li>Around 3-4 hours of reading<br></li><li>Painful ordeals<br></li><li>Spiders and needles</li></ul>",
